  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GYLA promotes increased legal awareness among the public, ensuring    that human rights are observed without discrimination, facilitate an  effective, accountable and transparent rule of law by developing      high-quality legal education. This contribution is continued support  from contribution no. 54000112.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">GYLA verkar f&#xf6;r en &#xf6;kad juridisk medvetenhet bland allm&#xe4;nheten,       s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla att de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna efterf&#xf6;ljs utan            diskriminering, underl&#xe4;tta f&#xf6;r en effektiv, ansvarsfull &#xf6;ppen         r&#xe4;ttsstat samt att utveckla och satsa p&#xe5; h&#xf6;gkvalitativ juridisk       utbildning. Fortsatt st&#xf6;d av insats 54000112 fr&#xe5;n f&#xf6;reg&#xe5;ende          strategiperiod.</narrative>
  </description>
